; tasks.my — durable compiler-first implementation plan for wsm-os.
; `done . t` is added only after pushed implementation and evidence exist.

((kind . tasks-my)
 (tasks .
  (("WSM-OS-TARGET-ABI-M0" .
    ((priority . 10.0)
     (done . t)
     (capabilities . (architecture x86_64 assembly compiler contract proof))
     (depends-on . ())
     (origin . wsm-os)
     (description . "Define the machine-readable wsm-os x86_64 target ABI before any emitter uses numeric constants: little-endian 64-bit values; nil/true/fixnum/symbol/cons tags; ownership, alignment and heap pointer rules; System V AMD64 integer calling convention; versioned wsm_cons/wsm_car/wsm_cdr/wsm_eq/wsm_atom/wsm_fail imports; canonical result and structured failure records. Pin my-lisp/CML SHAs and the first (cons (quote A) (quote B)) oracle fixture. Add parser/validation tests for the contract. Do not import Rust Value/NanBox layout as authority.")
     (context . "completed 2026-08-29 by wsl-viveka-1 under direct owner assignment after swarm claim quorum was unavailable: fe168eb pushed. Dependency-free no_std wsm-os-target crate is the numeric source of truth; generated target-contract.wsm is byte-exact tested; 5/5 ABI tests, cargo check --lib, cargo fmt and my-lisp lint pass. CI added.")))

