     (description . "Turn the deterministic M4 artifact manifest into one versioned definition capsule: stable definition ID, source digest and source map, contract revisions, code range/entry, literal and symbol table digests, callers/dependencies, imports and object digest. Validate deterministic regeneration and reject mismatched sections. This is inspectable metadata only: do not implement hot replacement, a loader or a world image in the same task.")))

   ("WSM-OS-SEMANTIC-TRACE-M5E" .
    ((priority . 7.6)
     (capabilities . (my-lisp cml x86_64 qemu fpga protocol conformance debugging proof))
     (depends-on . (WSM-OS-DEFINITION-CAPSULE-M5D WSM-OS-CML-TAIL-CALL-PROOF-M5C))
     (origin . wsm-os)
     (description . "Define and prove a bounded versioned semantic trace shared by my-lisp oracle, hosted generated x86 and QEMU, with an explicitly deferred fpga-lisp consumer. Minimum events: enter-definition, primitive-call, allocate logical-cell-id, branch, return and fail. Compare stable definition/object IDs and canonical values, never raw addresses, wall time or target instructions. Add one divergence fixture proving the checker reports the first semantic mismatch; a longer trace is execution evidence, not stronger truth authority.")))

   ("WSM-OS-IMMUTABLE-LITERAL-SPACE-DECISION-M5F" .
    ((priority . 6.8)
     (capabilities . (architecture cml x86_64 memory image contract proof))
     (depends-on . (WSM-OS-DEFINITION-CAPSULE-M5D))
     (origin . wsm-os)
     (description . "Decide whether quoted immutable cons graphs may live in a relocatable read-only image section instead of consuming the mutable bump heap at boot. Reconcile the proposal with the current ABI rule that every cons pointer is owned by the active heap; specify pointer validation, object identity, relocation, printer traversal and future GC interaction. Benchmark boot allocation on representative quoted fixtures. No backend may emit read-only cons pointers until the target contract is explicitly ratified and negative ownership tests exist.")))

   ("WSM-OS-STRUCTURED-CONDITION-RECORD-M5G" .
    ((priority . 6.5)
